───[ RADIANCE optimizations ]────────────────────────────────────
  feature toggles (set to 0 to disable):
    ON  RADIANCE_USE_R4D           hand-written gfx1201 kernels: attention, gated delta net, vision, all-reduce, skinny GEMM
    ON  RADIANCE_USE_R4D_AR        P2P one-shot all-reduce for TP=2, byte-identical to RCCL
    ON  RADIANCE_USE_R4D_AR_QUANT  compressed all-reduce payload for large messages: rotated 6-bit (on; not RCCL-identical)
    ON  RADIANCE_PRESHUFFLE        preshuffled AITER FP8 blockscale GEMM
    ON  RADIANCE_FUSE_RMS_QUANT    fold group-FP8 quant into the RMSNorm epilogue
    ON  RADIANCE_DYNAMIC_DRAFT     per-request MTP draft-depth controller (needs speculative mtp)
    OFF RADIANCE_FAST_DRAFT        2-bit MTP draft head behind an exact rerank (opt-in; needs speculative mtp)

  dynamic drafting (RADIANCE_DYNAMIC_DRAFT):
        per-slot confidence gate: draft while cum. confidence >= TAU, take a free-win
        n-gram, else verify; batch schedule caps serial MTP forwards at concurrency.
        · RADIANCE_DRAFT_SCHEDULE = 1:8,2:7,4:6,8:5,16:4  batch-size MTP-forward ceiling (bs:max_depth, carry-forward)
        · RADIANCE_DRAFT_TAU = 0.35  confidence-product stop threshold

  NUMA binding (RADIANCE_NUMA_BIND / --numa-bind):
        off (set =auto or pass --numa-bind to pin to the GPU-local node)

  startup:
        · RADIANCE_RUN_BWTEST = 0  GPU topology + bandwidth sweep at startup (on; backgrounded, ~1 s; set 0 to skip)
        · RADIANCE_BANNER_PLAIN = 1  disable ANSI color (also NO_COLOR)

  baked-in (always on; correctness + GEMM path):
    • block-FP8 GEMM dispatcher; preshuffle / AITER split-K / generic + tuned fp8-configs
    • tuned fused-MoE Triton configs for fine-grained MoE (Qwen3.6-35B-A3B E=256,N=256; ~-12% TTFT prefill)
    • bf16 / auto KV cache attention fit + tune (fits the RDNA4 64 KiB LDS at head_size 256)
    • amdsmi gfx1201 GPU enumeration fix (device_count / platform detect)
    • AITER enablement for gfx12x (upstream gates it to MI3xx / CDNA)
    • native sampler fallback (AITER top-k/top-p kernel absent on RDNA4)
    • MTP drafter unpad fix (enables disable_padded_drafter_batch single-stream path)
    • tool-parser streaming vs non-streaming consistency (vLLM #47137)
    • from_json Jinja filter for tool-calling chat templates

  AITER routing (VLLM_ROCM_USE_AITER*):
    AITER=1  AITER_UATTN=1  AITER_MHA=0  AITER_MLA=0  AITER_MOE=0  AITER_LINEAR=0  AITER_RMSNORM=0  AITER_FP8BMM=0

